{"c":[{"id":"8cb6849340a067ef","sum":"Cults schema lives at https://cults3d.com/graphiql. Unauthenticated POST /graphql is HTTP 401 Basic; a Discord writeup is not the schema. Changelog URL is models/<component>/CHANGELOG.md, with {version} and {changelog_url} interpolated.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261015T193710Z-dfd12b6e003046d4","text":"Issues: #11 move models under models/ first. #12 then interpolates {version} and {changelog_url} in the Cults boilerplate. Changelog URL uses models/<component>/CHANGELOG.md.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T193821Z-29567ccfd52d7e83","text":"Cults schema lives in https://cults3d.com/graphiql. Unauthenticated POST to /graphql is HTTP 401 Basic. A third-party Discord writeup is not the schema.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"6fecccc976b89bbb","sum":"Cults: updateCreation has no file/image URLs; add via createBlueprint/createIllustration(creationId, url), remove via destroyBlueprint/destroyIllustration(id). creation() takes a slug; myself.creationsBatch ids match the slug (global id = Creation/<slug>); rows return global id.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261015T194919Z-ca5ba2748fcbcd80","text":"Cults updateCreation has no file or image URLs. createBlueprint(creationId, fileUrl) and createIllustration(creationId, imageUrl) add them; destroyBlueprint(id) and destroyIllustration(id) remove them. myself.creationsBatch takes ids. creation() takes a slug.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T004939Z-ba3d20b148e83373","text":"Cults creationsBatch ids matches the slug, not the stored global id. A global id decodes to Creation/<slug>. The returned row id stays the global id.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
